    {
      "id": "claim_13a598b8029641f7923ce23b2c95419e",
      "statement": "The server manager generates `langgraph.json` with the `agent` graph reference `deepagents_code.server_graph:make_graph`; the factory validates workspace execution context when present, then selects a graph from the matching workspace runtime, and otherwise returns the cached process-wide graph.",
