      "statement": "Normal local dcode startup captures project context, validates explicit MCP configuration before spawning, scaffolds a temporary LangGraph workspace with a SQLite checkpointer, waits for the `agent` graph to be ready, configures the RemoteAgent workspace policy, and stops the owned server if startup or readiness fails.",
